.................... ////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////// 
.................... // read_adc_volts_mcp3421() 
.................... // Purpose: To read the last adc conversion from device, actual volt value read 
.................... //          from device. 
.................... // Parameter: address - Optional parameter for specifying the address of the 
